Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:24:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(recall): excerpt long hits around the query instead
 of truncating

Long recall hits were shortened to their first characters, which often cut
away the part that answered the pack's query. They are now excerpted around
the query terms so the retained lines stay relevant.

